! face.handle.grafts ~ the owner-set succession, declared and unwired

`lares handle graft` names the owner-set succession (true k-of-n graft governance) and declines to act: the KEL mint stands in @lararium/mesh (`mintHandleGraft`), and the vessel-side orchestration awaits its pass. It exits 3.

